// 🗂️ 홈 정리(묶음 접기 · 메뉴 찾기 · 메뉴 숨기기) · ⛄ 방학 계획표 · 🏫 초등 교과 핵심 표현

// ── 🗂️ 홈 정리 ──
function setupHomeTools(root, profileName) {
  const screen = root.querySelector(".screen-home");
  // 숨긴 메뉴 빼기
  const hidden = new Set(getHomeHidden(profileName));
  root.querySelectorAll(".tile").forEach((t) => hidden.has(t.id) && t.remove());
  const groups = [...root.querySelectorAll(".group")].filter((g) => g.id !== "pinGroup" && g.querySelector(".tile-grid"));
  const collapsed = new Set(getHomeCollapsed(profileName));
  for (const g of groups) {
    const title = g.querySelector(".group-title");
    const key = title.textContent.trim();
    const count = g.querySelectorAll(".tile").length;
    if (!count) {
      g.hidden = true;
      continue;
    }
    g.dataset.key = key;
    title.classList.add("group-toggle");
    title.setAttribute("role", "button");
    title.setAttribute("tabindex", "0");
    title.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend", ` <small class="group-count">${count}</small><span class="group-caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>`);
    const apply = () => {
      const on = collapsed.has(key);
      g.classList.toggle("collapsed", on);
      title.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(!on));
    };
    apply();
    const toggle = () => {
      collapsed.has(key) ? collapsed.delete(key) : collapsed.add(key);
      setHomeCollapsed(profileName, [...collapsed]);
      apply();
    };
    title.addEventListener("click", toggle);
    title.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => (e.key === "Enter" || e.key === " ") && (e.preventDefault(), toggle()));
  }
  // 메뉴 찾기
  const input = root.querySelector("#homeSearch");
  if (!input) return;
  const norm = (s) => s.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, "");
  const empty = root.querySelector("#homeSearchEmpty");
  input.addEventListener("input", () => {
    const q = norm(input.value);
    screen.classList.toggle("searching", !!q);
    let found = 0;
    for (const g of [...groups, root.querySelector("#pinGroup")].filter(Boolean)) {
      let n = 0;
      g.querySelectorAll(".tile").forEach((t) => {
        const hit = !q || norm(t.textContent + " " + (HOME_TILE_ALIASES[t.id] || "")).includes(q);
        t.hidden = !hit;
        if (hit) n++;
      });
      g.classList.toggle("search-hit", !!q && n > 0);
      found += n;
    }
    empty.hidden = !q || found > 0;
  });
}

